# Bench snapshot contract

## Entities

### Entity: BenchSnapshot

Implementation: crates/bench-core/src/lib.rs.

```yaml
entity: BenchSnapshot
type: entity
properties:
  schema_version:
    type: integer
    required: true
  tick:
    type: integer
    required: true
  source:
    type: enum
    required: true
    values: [simulated, recorded, live]
  machine:
    type: object
    required: true
  instruments:
    type: array
    required: true
  warnings:
    type: array
    required: true
```

### Entity: MachineState

Unavailable measurements remain null, not zero. Spindle speed must be non-negative.

```yaml
entity: MachineState
type: entity
properties:
  x_mm:
    type: number
    required: false
  z_mm:
    type: number
    required: false
  spindle_rpm:
    type: number
    required: false
  program_state:
    type: string
    required: true
```

### Entity: InstrumentState

```yaml
entity: InstrumentState
type: entity
properties:
  device_id:
    type: string
    required: true
  captured_at_ms:
    type: integer
    required: false
  stale:
    type: boolean
    required: true
  units:
    type: string
    required: false
```

### Entity: Diagnostics

Implementation: crates/bench-core/src/diagnostics.rs. Local records retain bounded
details. This is an in-memory store, not a deserializable document. Shared output
excludes free text, routes, paths and session identifiers.

```yaml
entity: Diagnostics
type: entity
properties:
  events:
    type: array
    required: true
  sequence:
    type: integer
    required: true
```

### Entity: Command

Implementation: crates/bench-cli/src/main.rs. The command schema is
crates/bench-cli/schemas/commands.json. Commands read local files, not live app state.

```yaml
entity: Command
type: entity
properties:
  command:
    type: enum
    required: true
    values: [demo, validate-snapshot, diagnostics, schema]
  path:
    type: string
    required: false
  json:
    type: boolean
    required: false
  kind:
    type: enum
    required: false
    values: [commands, snapshot, diagnostics]
```

### Entity: DiagnosticEvent

```yaml
entity: DiagnosticEvent
type: entity
description: Private local record in crates/bench-core/src/diagnostics.rs; not serializable.
properties:
  id:
    type: string
    required: true
  count:
    type: integer
    required: true
  last_ms:
    type: integer
    required: true
  elapsed_ms:
    type: integer
    required: false
  failure:
    type: object
    required: true
```

### Entity: Failure

```yaml
entity: Failure
type: entity
description: Rust enum with Client, Application and Transfer variants; private local details.
```

### Entity: DiagnosticReport

```yaml
entity: DiagnosticReport
type: entity
description: Serializable metadata-only report; operation is a closed ReportOperation enum, not private text.
properties:
  schema:
    type: string
    required: true
  events:
    type: array
    required: true
```

