## Relationships

```yaml
entity: EquipmentList
type: entity
properties:
  schema:
    type: string
    required: true
  name:
    type: string
    required: true
  devices:
    type: array
    required: true
```

```yaml
entity: file:web/hardware/equipment-config.js
type: file
```

```yaml
entity: file:web/hardware/equipment.schema.json
type: file
```

```yaml
entity: file:web/hardware/equipment-config.test.js
type: file
```

```yaml
source: file:web/hardware/equipment-config.js
target: EquipmentList
verb: defines
```

```yaml
source: file:web/hardware/equipment.schema.json
target: EquipmentList
verb: documents
```

```yaml
source: file:web/hardware/equipment-config.test.js
target: EquipmentList
verb: tests
```

```yaml
source: HardwareBench
target: EquipmentList
verb: uses
```

The file nodes below bind authored contracts to implementation, format and test
files. They are not automatically extracted Rust symbols or execution evidence.

```yaml
entity: file:crates/bench-core/src/lib.rs
type: file
description: Snapshot definitions, validation and unit tests.
```

```yaml
entity: file:crates/bench-core/src/diagnostics.rs
type: file
description: Diagnostic definitions, export boundaries and unit tests.
```

```yaml
entity: file:crates/bench-cli/src/main.rs
type: file
description: CLI parsing and execution.
```

```yaml
entity: file:crates/bench-core/schemas/snapshot.json
type: file
description: Snapshot interchange format.
```

```yaml
entity: file:crates/bench-core/schemas/client-errors.json
type: file
description: Client-error input format, not the shared report format.
```

```yaml
entity: file:crates/bench-cli/schemas/commands.json
type: file
description: JSON command request format.
```

```yaml
entity: file:crates/bench-cli/tests/cli.rs
type: file
description: Executable CLI integration checks.
```

### Relationship: BenchSnapshot → MachineState

```yaml
source: BenchSnapshot
target: MachineState
verb: records
cardinality: 1:1
```

### Relationship: BenchSnapshot → InstrumentState

```yaml
source: BenchSnapshot
target: InstrumentState
verb: includes
cardinality: 1:N
```

### Relationship: Command → BenchSnapshot

```yaml
source: Command
target: BenchSnapshot
verb: validates
```

